00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.980
Here they come. There's two of them.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:52.790
And they don't even have any soldiers. This will be easy.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.920
When I give the signal, you know what to do.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:56.930
Okay.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.600
Boss!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.640
The rice porridge is ready.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.290
We're heading back!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.760
Ronja?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.320
Where are you, Ronja?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.860
Hey?

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.470
This isn't the time for hide and seek.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.720
Where is she?

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.940
Show Daddy your pretty face.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:14.130
Oh dear, it seems that Ronja's birth has made them all idiots.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:23.360
Nice of you to come back while the sun is still up.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.730
Ronja?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.370
Ronja?

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:37.490
You're not telling me you pulled out of a job again just to feed Ronja, are you?

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.390
Where are you? Ronja?

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.660
Where are you?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.490
Fjosok. Sturkas.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.160
I can't believe you guys.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.850
When Mattis is doing something wrong,

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:54.710
say "Boss, you're wrong." Even if you have to throw some punches.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:57.590
That's a part of your job.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:02.130
Yet, in spite of that, all of you...

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.660
Jutis, Klippen! Are you even listening?!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.240
Oh, my sweet little dove!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.490
Here, say "Ah”.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:44.860
Say "Ah", and open your mouth nice and wide, like this.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.220
Ah...

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.540
Now chew.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.010
Om nom!

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.060
"Ah".

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.020
Ah.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:24.430
Boss, your face...

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.700
How embarrassing.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:42.140
You idiots! You startled my little dove and now she's crying!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.330
You only made it worse.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.340
Your voice is much louder than ours.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:10.320
Hey!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:26.220
Oh dear, who would ever think that you're the most powerful robber chieftain in all the woods?

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:32.140
If Borka saw your face now, he'd probably laugh so hard that he'd wet his pants.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.750
I'll make sure he never has the privilege.

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.020
Borka! They're here!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:49.220
We haven't seen Mattis for a while.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:53.680
Yeah, that makes it much easier.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:58.950
They're coming!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.600
Huh? Boss?

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.540
It's about that time again.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:07.810
What?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:10.810
Borka?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.140
Retreat!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.010
Hey, come here, Ronja.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.760
Up, up.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:18.260
My little dove. When it comes to crawling, you are clearly top of the class.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:24.310
She moved her left leg and managed to turn smoothly.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.360
Uh-huh.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.870
That is a performance no other child could ever match.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.860
Most children can do that.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.540
Up, up.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:41.460
Then, Mattis? Are you going to give all of the treasures of the forest over to Borka?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.920
We took plenty of treasure on our way back.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:50.390
Here!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.690
Ronja! Look at mine too!

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.310
No way, check this out!

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.930
What are you saying? Me too!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.700
Me too.

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:22.100
Ronja?

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.180
Here you go.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.060
You damn idiot!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.380
Throw that thing away right now!

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.550
Ronja!

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.290
You are as beautiful as a wild harpy!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:14.200
Your body is as supple, your eyes are as dark-eyed,

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.420
and you are black-haired as one!

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:18.700
Don't you think so?

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.400
Yeah!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.160
You guys!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:26.620
You never saw such a splendid child in all your lives, I'll have you know!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.710
Am I right?

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:29.210
Yeah!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:31.410
Up you go!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.660
She's beautiful!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.750
Hooray!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.540
Time flies so fast.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:37.780
It seems like just a moment ago, she was crawling around on the floor.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.250
I feel the same way.

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:43.280
Ah?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.460
Good morning!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.220
Good morning, Per.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:32.490
Good Morning.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.920
Good morning, Sturkas.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.450
Good morning.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.340
Jutis, Turre!

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.340
Pelje!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:41.890
Good morning.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:42.970
Knotas!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:44.170
Hi.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:49.610
Joen!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.170
Good morning!

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:00.800
Here, eat up!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:25.840
What's the matter?

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.650
Lovis,

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:32.910
our child must learn what it's like living in Matt's Forest.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.550
We should let her go out on her own.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:41.600
So you finally get it?

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:48.090
It would have happened long ago if I'd had my way.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:16:59.390
Ronja!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.100
What, Dad?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.290
Hey, look!

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:09.040
They laid a lot of eggs today!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.900
We need to talk.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.020
Hmm?

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.870
Here. It's ready.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.970
Thanks, Mom!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:39.670
I'm off!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.350
Take care.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.920
Dad, I'm leaving.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.130
Ronja.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:31.240
There are wild harpies, gray dwarves, and Borka's robbers in the forest.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:32.720
Be wary of them.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:39.990
How will I tell which are wild harpies and gray dwarves and Borka's robbers?

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.570
That's, well, you know...

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:45.110
You'll find out.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.900
Okay, got it.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.520
And also...

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:53.680
Be careful not to get lost in the forest.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:58.330
If I get lost, what should I do?

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.360
Try to find the commonly traveled path.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.440
Okay, got it.

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:06.760
And also, be careful not to fall into the river.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:10.420
If I fall into the river, what should I do?

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.530
Swim.

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.470
Okay, I got it.

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:19.920
And also, be careful not to tumble down into into Hell's Gap.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.960
If I tumble down into the Hell's Gap, what should I do?

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.080
In that situation...

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.620
In that situation...?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.290
There's nothing you can do.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.620
Okay, I got it.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:12.300
Then, I won't tumble down into the Hell's Gap.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.530
Anything else?

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.740
Yes.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.970
But you'll find out bit by bit.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.060
Now go!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:39.880
Yup.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.040
Wow!

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:37.970
Make sure you're back before the sun sets!

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.500
I got it!

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.730
We'll go out too!

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:51.380
Understood!

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:54.720
Hey.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:56.340
Huh?

00:21:58.700 --> 00:21:59.910
It's Ronja!

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:02.230
Ronja!

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:04.890
Where are you going, all by yourself?

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:12.230
I'm going into the forest!

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:15.400
I get to go into the forest now!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:20.910
There are wild harpies, gray dwarves, and Borka's robbers in the forest...

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:24.520
I already know all that!

00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:10.050
And so it was, Ronja left the Mattis Castle for the first time in her life,

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:12.970
and started spending her days in the forest.

